+From fb512deb558fc1f53314112bd08f8314ff38cba1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Mqsirrel <68720462+Mqsirrel@users.noreply.github.com>
+Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 22:56:58 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH] feat(theme): restore all seven palettes with WCAG AAA/AA
+ contrast
+
+Bring back the full 7-palette set that was lost with the previous
+session's untracked commit: slate (default), midnight, ember, moss,
+neon, mono and warm. Adds Palette.contrast_ratio()/_luminance() and
+Palette.swatch() for the theme picker, plus module-level mix()/ramp()
+helpers used by the gradient bar. Docs updated to the seven themes.
+
+Verified against the measured contrast table: every palette's text is
+AAA (\u22657:1) and muted is AA (\u22654.5:1), exactly as reported.
+
+Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
